OL,3,ATrump says he is banning CNN and
OL,4,APolitico from White House
OL,5,
OL,6,FTrump later called it a "very simple
OL,7,Fban", but did not explain how it would
OL,8,Fwork. It is unclear whether employees
OL,9,Fof those outlets would be prevented
OL,10,Ffrom entering the White House grounds.
OL,12,FThe move is likely to be met with legal
OL,13,Fchallenges from the outlets involved
OL,14,Fand press freedom organisations.
OL,23,APub: 18-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
